Symptom on this bench: clip of shift.dmp shows a neighbour body even though
reknit returns success. Other dumps that still sit on their original units
already clip cleanly.

A later row for the same name can look tempting when a unit recently moved.
Twin helper names in two live units still have to clip from the dump's own unit.
Grade-time dumps may appear under /app/lotbay and extra units under /app/unitpit.

